WEBVTT

00:22.040 --> 00:23.680
<i>ONE MORE TIME</i>

00:23.880 --> 00:28.630
I LOOKED AT THE BLOOMING
FLOWERS IN MY SHINING DREAM

00:28.800 --> 00:32.350
<i>NO MORE LIFE</i>
I WAS OBSESSED

00:35.280 --> 00:38.670
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
BY THOSE HANDS

00:42.160 --> 00:45.310
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
BY A LIGHT SHINING

00:45.480 --> 00:48.710
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
IN THE DARKNESS

00:48.880 --> 00:52.320
<i>ONE MORE TIME</i>
IN THE TWINKLING LIGHT

00:52.480 --> 00:55.440
WATCH THAT FIGURE FADE AWAY

00:55.600 --> 00:59.230
<i>NO MORE LIFE</i>
I WAS LEFT BEHIND

00:59.400 --> 01:02.150
BUT TOMORROW WE'LL MEET AGAIN

01:02.320 --> 01:05.440
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
BY THOSE HANDS

01:05.600 --> 01:08.750
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
I WAS CALLED

01:08.920 --> 01:12.150
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
BY A LIGHT SHINING

01:12.320 --> 01:15.470
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
IN THE DARKNESS

01:15.640 --> 01:21.400
SURROUNDED BY THE LIGHT

01:21.560 --> 01:23.840
<i>DON'T CLOSE EYES
HELP ME</i>

01:24.000 --> 01:29.330
WHEN I SCREAM
<i>WILL BE SATISFACTION, YOU KNOW</i>

01:32.820 --> 01:37.040
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.410 --> 01:41.210
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with
thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.210 --> 01:48.130
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various
daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.130 --> 01:51.300
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.300 --> 01:56.390
At the same time, beings seeking
to end the period of turbulence

01:56.390 --> 02:00.270
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.270 --> 02:04.520
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.520 --> 02:06.520
And then...

02:06.520 --> 02:09.980
On the fifteenth day of the
ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:09.980 --> 02:12.740
the Eastern Army of
Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:12.740 --> 02:17.870
the Western Army of the Toyotomi
clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:17.870 --> 02:21.330
As a result of the performance of
Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.330 --> 02:27.250
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and
Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.250 --> 02:33.510
bringing what should have been three
hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.340 --> 02:39.390
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:44.880 --> 02:47.550
My name is Yume.
I am a girl who dreams.

02:48.200 --> 02:55.440
I'm traveling with Musashi,
Ronin, Desperado and Ninjataro.

02:56.320 --> 03:03.430
We are in search of the seven artifacts which
allow us to imprison the ayakashi forever.

03:03.600 --> 03:09.160
But during our journey, Musashi
dropped our hard-earned artifact.

03:09.680 --> 03:15.110
Oh my God, a pike appeared
in the pond and greeted us.

03:15.320 --> 03:20.120
Sorry, it wasn't a pike
that came out of the pond,

03:20.320 --> 03:23.230
but the very powerful
mechanical puppet Rasetsu.

03:23.920 --> 03:32.110
Princess Kaguya, Danjo and Sasuke Sarutobi
continued searching for another artifact.

03:32.280 --> 03:39.520
But they got attacked by an
ayakashi-like mass of energy.

03:40.600 --> 03:44.550
And that's when Yasha, the leader of the ayakashi, appeared,

03:44.720 --> 03:50.830
with Urashima, the Yin-yang
monk. This got really serious.

03:51.800 --> 03:56.800
Don't you think that Yasha and
Urashima look strangely alike?

03:57.960 --> 04:02.030
They have the same stature
and exactly the same voice.

04:02.560 --> 04:06.790
Those two are hiding something.

04:06.960 --> 04:09.080
I have talked too much.

04:09.600 --> 04:12.240
It's time for the episode of the day.

04:17.250 --> 04:20.060
POND AND LIMESTONE CAVE

04:29.560 --> 04:31.310
Just as I expected.

04:41.720 --> 04:43.040
Musashi...

04:43.400 --> 04:44.600
No!

04:45.280 --> 04:47.780
He wants to take him to a parallel space-time!

04:48.080 --> 04:50.550
Master Musashi, free yourself!

04:51.800 --> 04:55.030
That's impossible!
It is too strong!

04:59.200 --> 05:01.320
The shell is too thick!

05:04.720 --> 05:06.680
Master Musashi!

05:07.320 --> 05:08.640
He disappeared...

05:09.160 --> 05:12.070
He was transported to a parallel space-time.

05:12.280 --> 05:13.480
Yes.

05:17.600 --> 05:19.160
Will he come out of it?

05:21.640 --> 05:23.710
No need to worry about him.

05:24.520 --> 05:27.560
We can only wait for him to return.

05:28.200 --> 05:30.670
But will he be able to return?

05:30.840 --> 05:32.270
Who knows.

05:33.120 --> 05:34.550
Musashi...

05:57.240 --> 06:02.230
Yasha. I should have settled
the score with you.

06:02.880 --> 06:06.630
Have you fought in the past?

06:07.880 --> 06:10.110
My head is about to explode...

06:12.080 --> 06:16.390
I'm beginning to remember...
here, there are...

06:17.080 --> 06:21.230
You did lose some of your memories.

06:23.040 --> 06:25.840
I see, then it was so...

06:26.000 --> 06:31.670
I understand. In the past,
I fought against you, and then...

06:32.400 --> 06:41.680
Urashima, be careful! Yasha absorbed the
ayakashi's power and became stronger!

06:42.320 --> 06:43.640
It seems so.

06:43.840 --> 06:45.480
Princess Kaguya.

06:45.640 --> 06:50.390
Have you encountered Yasha and Urashima before?

06:51.120 --> 06:52.390
Briefly.

06:53.520 --> 06:56.880
You never told me that!
Under what circumstances?

06:57.480 --> 07:00.790
Isn't it impudent to inquire about a woman's past?

07:00.960 --> 07:02.470
Forgive me.

07:09.480 --> 07:11.520
- It can't be...
- The artifact!

07:12.000 --> 07:18.310
Yes, it is the third artifact I have
hidden in this underground castle.

07:29.600 --> 07:34.120
Kaguya, keep it until
I am done with Yasha.

07:34.800 --> 07:36.070
Understood.

07:36.600 --> 07:38.480
Done?

07:38.640 --> 07:42.950
And how are you going to do that when
you don't even have a body anymore?

07:44.000 --> 07:46.040
Tell me, ayakashi.

07:46.520 --> 07:47.720
What is it?

07:48.320 --> 07:53.710
Earlier, you said you were siding
with Princess Kaguya, didn't you?

07:54.320 --> 08:02.880
Clearly! Yasha, that renegade, has deceived us,
we who have existed since the dawn of time.

08:03.240 --> 08:09.320
He stole our energy and magic so
that he could then annihilate us.

08:10.160 --> 08:14.950
To avenge the ayakashi,
I am ready to die!

08:15.440 --> 08:19.910
In that case, I ask you to lend
me the energy of the ayakashi.

08:20.560 --> 08:22.070
Understood.

08:23.480 --> 08:26.280
<i>Rin! Pyo! To! Sha!</i>

08:26.440 --> 08:30.040
<i>Kai! Jin! Retsu! Zai! Zen!</i>

08:37.800 --> 08:40.680
What powerful energy!

08:45.240 --> 08:49.960
Urashima is absorbing the
energy of the ayakashi!

08:57.160 --> 08:58.830
This place again?

08:59.520 --> 09:03.590
This is where that rascal
Shingen Takeda had brought me.

09:04.160 --> 09:05.390
Yes, the same place.

09:06.960 --> 09:08.160
I see you!

09:17.720 --> 09:19.040
Flaming bullet!

09:28.960 --> 09:33.600
No problem... how about this!

09:33.920 --> 09:35.150
Take that!

09:42.400 --> 09:43.750
What?

09:48.560 --> 09:50.040
I understand...

09:50.200 --> 09:54.800
In this space-time, our powers
seem to increase tenfold.

09:56.600 --> 09:58.510
It is perfect for combat.

10:10.600 --> 10:12.910
You'll never hit me...

10:13.120 --> 10:17.190
And I will recover the two artifacts!

10:32.200 --> 10:34.270
Urashima's body...

10:34.440 --> 10:37.110
Absorbed the energy of the ayakashi!

10:37.600 --> 10:41.590
"Hurry up" is my order!

10:55.760 --> 10:58.960
I am ready.
So where do we fight?

10:59.880 --> 11:04.030
- You already know the answer!
- I do.

11:05.400 --> 11:08.710
Kaguya, I'm going.

11:13.480 --> 11:14.800
Urashima...

11:16.520 --> 11:18.510
Don't make that face.

11:19.160 --> 11:22.470
I have to deal with Yasha sooner or later.

11:24.880 --> 11:27.190
Princess Kaguya!

11:29.880 --> 11:32.190
Urashima, may fortune be with you.

11:36.280 --> 11:38.870
He holds her in his arms... fortune...

11:39.040 --> 11:40.240
Yes.

11:41.680 --> 11:42.880
Now...

11:43.240 --> 11:44.440
I have to go.

11:46.320 --> 11:51.720
I will make you regret coming out
of sleep from inside the artifact!

11:52.720 --> 11:59.670
Kaguya, guard the artifact
until I come looking for it.

12:05.240 --> 12:06.440
They have disappeared.

12:07.400 --> 12:09.600
Where did they go?

12:10.080 --> 12:15.270
Probably in the space-time
where they fought before.

12:16.040 --> 12:17.270
Space-time?

12:18.080 --> 12:26.230
A different space-time in which ayakashi power and Yin-Yang power reach climax.

12:27.040 --> 12:32.350
Yasha and Urashima have fought
there before in the past, is that right?

12:32.920 --> 12:34.150
The fight...

12:34.320 --> 12:36.710
was so violent...

12:37.600 --> 12:39.670
that it ripped through earth and sky.

12:39.880 --> 12:42.520
And who won?

12:43.480 --> 12:45.760
Yasha won.

12:46.200 --> 12:47.400
What?

12:47.680 --> 12:54.070
Urashima, beaten, then had his
body, his materiality, stolen.

12:54.520 --> 12:58.040
Who was it that stole it?

12:59.000 --> 13:01.640
Urashima, be careful.

13:13.560 --> 13:15.680
I'm bored out of my mind!

13:17.240 --> 13:18.800
I'm bored!

13:24.120 --> 13:27.190
Hey, Leonardo da Vinci, can you hear me?

13:29.720 --> 13:33.630
Hey, brilliant scientist, sublime artist!

13:34.600 --> 13:37.640
- Did you call me?
- What are you up to?

13:39.200 --> 13:40.430
What do you think?

13:41.400 --> 13:44.920
Do not beat around the bush!
Answer now, <i>señorita</i>!

13:45.680 --> 13:47.590
A teleportation machine!

13:47.960 --> 13:51.950
A thorn bush to urinate in?

13:52.120 --> 13:56.590
If I do that, I risk losing my vital organ!

13:56.760 --> 13:59.560
I'll have a very good reason to be shy!

14:02.000 --> 14:05.550
You know, Yasha is able to move through space.

14:05.880 --> 14:09.110
I wanted a machine to do the same thing.

14:10.160 --> 14:11.560
That's great!

14:12.400 --> 14:15.630
Take me somewhere right now!

14:16.040 --> 14:18.320
Wherever you want, but far away from here.

14:18.800 --> 14:22.270
You are a bit too frustrated right now!

14:22.680 --> 14:24.110
Come on, quickly!

14:24.840 --> 14:28.630
Stop rushing, the machine is not finished.

14:29.040 --> 14:30.710
What?

14:31.600 --> 14:33.590
Damn, I almost believed it.

14:44.000 --> 14:45.590
Unbelievable, it's working!

14:47.160 --> 14:49.390
Did I do something stupid?

14:54.600 --> 14:57.910
This place brings back memories.

14:59.080 --> 15:00.280
Indeed.

15:00.600 --> 15:05.880
I defeated you here and took this body.

15:06.840 --> 15:09.830
That won't happen again.

15:15.480 --> 15:16.710
Yin-Yang waves!

15:22.600 --> 15:28.000
I see. By absorbing ayakashi
energy, you became stronger.

15:29.120 --> 15:32.190
And you, on the other hand,
became weaker, Urashima.

15:33.160 --> 15:34.360
We shall see.

15:49.160 --> 15:52.440
I didn't come here to take punches!

16:00.080 --> 16:02.070
Won't it explode?

16:03.120 --> 16:05.510
I couldn't say...

16:06.080 --> 16:08.520
But it's getting interesting.

16:09.040 --> 16:10.240
Interesting?

16:11.120 --> 16:14.160
The meter detects a spatial distortion...

16:14.880 --> 16:19.910
and an electromagnetic
corridor to another space-time.

16:20.440 --> 16:22.720
Explain it to me in simpler words!

16:24.640 --> 16:28.600
In other words, we have
a machine that allows...

16:28.760 --> 16:36.440
not to teleport but to mix
our time-space with another.

16:37.040 --> 16:39.400
I still don't get it!

16:39.880 --> 16:45.760
In short, this world was affected by a warped magnetic field.

16:45.920 --> 16:52.470
That certainly explains the distortion of history
and the advent of the Osaka Shogunate.

16:52.640 --> 16:55.590
But I feel that this warped
world will find its way back....

16:55.600 --> 17:01.200
to the path of true history thanks
to a force whose origin I ignore.

17:01.360 --> 17:03.400
And that's a sign of it!

17:04.800 --> 17:11.070
Will we therefore find the history in which I
finished uniting and dominating the country?

17:13.440 --> 17:14.640
Answer me!

17:15.000 --> 17:18.230
I don't know what will happen.

17:18.400 --> 17:20.070
I'm sorry.

17:24.480 --> 17:27.070
What's going on?

17:30.720 --> 17:31.990
Time-space is warping!

17:32.400 --> 17:34.550
Make this explosion stop!

17:34.760 --> 17:37.640
I'm scared!
Mom, I'm scared!

17:40.280 --> 17:43.830
Earthquake?
Lightning strikes? Fires?

17:44.000 --> 17:47.200
What does this strange atmosphere mean?

17:47.360 --> 17:49.920
Space-time is warping!

17:51.040 --> 17:53.160
Space-time is warping?

17:53.320 --> 17:58.550
I have the same feeling as when
Yasha and Urashima fought.

17:59.360 --> 18:01.510
What happened then?

18:01.680 --> 18:03.190
I don't know.

18:03.360 --> 18:04.560
- But...
- But?

18:05.280 --> 18:07.590
It's a terrible thing.

18:08.040 --> 18:09.470
I feel it.

18:09.960 --> 18:12.430
Something terrible?

18:13.880 --> 18:15.200
Sasuke?

18:16.000 --> 18:17.990
My body...

18:19.120 --> 18:22.430
Sasuke, take my hand!

18:25.920 --> 18:27.120
He disappeared!

18:27.960 --> 18:30.600
Why only he disappeared?

18:35.480 --> 18:37.760
What does this atmosphere mean?

18:38.360 --> 18:43.760
This is the first time I've heard
something so distressing and terrifying.

18:44.520 --> 18:45.720
The space-time...

18:46.360 --> 18:48.270
Space-time is warping!

18:48.440 --> 18:50.320
Is this an omen?

18:51.040 --> 18:53.270
Everybody, be careful!

18:53.800 --> 18:55.470
Wake up, Ninjataro!

18:57.480 --> 19:00.200
I am Ninjataro...

19:00.360 --> 19:01.950
Be careful!

19:02.720 --> 19:05.110
- Ninjataro!
- Wake up!

19:05.520 --> 19:06.720
Ninjataro!

19:08.680 --> 19:12.750
My name is Ninja<i>taro</i>, not <i>shiro</i>...

19:12.920 --> 19:16.390
Understand?
On guard!

19:18.680 --> 19:20.190
Ninjataro...

19:20.360 --> 19:22.720
- He disappeared!
- Yes.

19:39.440 --> 19:40.640
What?

19:59.360 --> 20:03.070
Urashima, I will defeat you once again!

20:09.760 --> 20:10.960
How?

20:11.560 --> 20:13.360
Space-time warp...

20:13.560 --> 20:14.760
Why?

20:15.760 --> 20:21.670
You, ayakashi, assimilated into my body, carry out your vengeance!

20:25.400 --> 20:28.390
Bastard, you're powerless!

20:29.120 --> 20:32.350
You have always deceived and annihilated us!

20:32.960 --> 20:36.030
The time for revenge has come!

20:36.240 --> 20:38.470
Do you think you can beat me?

20:40.360 --> 20:43.420
- No need to beat you.
- What?

20:43.440 --> 20:45.560
You and me, will again become...

20:46.120 --> 20:47.550
one!

20:50.440 --> 20:53.590
<i>Rin! Pyo! To! Shal! Kai!</i>

20:53.760 --> 20:56.910
<i>Jin! Restu! Zai! Zen!</i>

20:57.120 --> 20:59.400
Bastard, you planned this!

20:59.600 --> 21:03.830
I will stop you!
I will not return this body to you!

21:04.520 --> 21:06.270
No need for you to return it to me.

21:07.200 --> 21:08.400
What do you mean?

21:08.960 --> 21:12.350
Everything will be like it was before.
Like it was before that day.

21:12.520 --> 21:16.280
- Do you think that's possible?
- It is.

21:17.480 --> 21:19.280
As long as that man is with us.

21:19.800 --> 21:21.000
That man?

21:21.560 --> 21:25.270
As long as Musashi, the savior
of the world, is with us!

21:25.920 --> 21:27.590
Stop joking around!

21:27.760 --> 21:29.190
Goodbye, Yasha.

21:36.720 --> 21:38.710
It's you, Ninjataro!

21:39.600 --> 21:40.920
Sasuke Sarutobi!

21:45.320 --> 21:48.710
- My body...
- ...and my body...

21:48.880 --> 21:50.920
They are merging!

21:54.040 --> 21:56.320
I knew it would explode!

22:05.360 --> 22:06.560
What's going on?

22:07.000 --> 22:09.230
Where am I?

22:16.200 --> 22:17.870
That's my chance.

22:18.440 --> 22:20.350
Don't wake up.

22:21.960 --> 22:23.160
Dammit!

22:37.040 --> 22:38.240
Musashi!

22:38.400 --> 22:39.600
Are you okay?

22:40.040 --> 22:41.710
What about the artifacts?

22:45.880 --> 22:47.080
Catch!

22:49.920 --> 22:51.120
Nice throw.

22:51.280 --> 22:52.630
Not bad, yes.

22:53.120 --> 22:54.550
Where is Ninjataro?

22:55.000 --> 22:56.270
Well...

23:02.360 --> 23:03.560
Ninjataro!

23:03.720 --> 23:05.310
Are you okay?

23:05.480 --> 23:06.750
We were worried!

23:07.320 --> 23:09.680
My name is Sasuke Sarutobi!

23:09.840 --> 23:12.560
I am and will remain Sasuke Sarutobi!

23:12.800 --> 23:14.070
Where is Ninjataro?

23:14.280 --> 23:17.080
He disappeared.

23:23.360 --> 23:24.710
Urashima.

23:24.880 --> 23:26.280
Thank you for waiting.

23:26.440 --> 23:28.160
What about Yasha?

23:28.600 --> 23:30.590
I won.

23:31.000 --> 23:33.440
This means...

23:34.040 --> 23:35.240
Yasha disappeared...

23:38.160 --> 23:43.560
In short, saying Yasha disappeared from <i>this world</i> would be more accurate.

23:43.760 --> 23:45.320
Is that true?

23:46.440 --> 23:47.640
Urashima...

23:48.480 --> 23:52.600
History can resume its natural and authentic course.

24:25.360 --> 24:27.160
THROUGH THE CROWDS

24:27.320 --> 24:31.080
THEY'RE CUTTING OFF YOUR ESCAPE

24:31.240 --> 24:34.950
IN THIS TWILIGHT TOWN
I HEAR PIERCING SOUNDS

24:35.120 --> 24:38.880
LIKE A WANDERING CAT

24:39.040 --> 24:40.790
WITHOUT KNOWING

24:40.960 --> 24:42.760
WHERE TO GO

24:42.920 --> 24:46.680
I'M TRAPPED IN THIS TOWN THAT NEVER SLEEPS

24:46.840 --> 24:50.360
MY REFLECTION IN THE MIRROR

24:50.520 --> 24:55.200
SEEING MYSELF TRANSFORM

24:55.360 --> 24:57.720
I'M HOLDING ON

24:57.880 --> 25:01.160
FOR AS LONG AS POSSIBLE

25:03.200 --> 25:07.830
I'LL SHOW YOU THAT I CAN

25:08.000 --> 25:10.560
WIN OVER THIS TOWN

25:11.720 --> 25:13.760
FROM MY BURNING HEART

25:13.920 --> 25:15.910
SHINE SO MANY

25:16.080 --> 25:19.870
DAZZLING COLORS AND LIGHTS

25:20.040 --> 25:21.550
FLOODING ALL OVER

25:21.720 --> 25:23.710
SCATTERING ALL OVER

25:23.880 --> 25:27.030
SURROUNDING ME

25:27.200 --> 25:29.650
SOLEMNLY

25:31.520 --> 25:35.070
Hey? Has Yasha been
absorbed by Urashima?

25:35.240 --> 25:39.910
And now Urashima orders
me to deal with that guy?

25:40.320 --> 25:43.120
The next chapter: <i>The Annihilation of the Ayakashi!</i>
